    `Searching for MobileNetV3`_.

    .. math::
        \text{Hardswish}(x) = \begin{cases}
            0 & \text{if~} x \le -3, \\
            x & \text{if~} x \ge +3, \\
            x \cdot (x + 3) /6 & \text{otherwise}
        \end{cases}

    See :class:`~torch.nn.Hardswish` for more details.

    .. _`Searching for MobileNetV3`:
        https://arxiv.org/abs/1905.02244

